### Payout Management Endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Create Payout (Idempotent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

{
  "beneficiary_id": "{{beneficiaryId}}",
  "destination_id": "{{destinationId}}",
  "amount": 1000,
  "currency": "USD",
  "memo": "Payment for services"
}

### List All Payouts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Process Payout (Create in Stripe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts/{{payoutId}}/process
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Cancel Payout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts/{{payoutId}}/cancel
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Get Payout Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payouts/{{payoutId}}/status
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### Example Payout Response:
# {
#   "id": "payout-uuid",
#   "status": "pending",
#   "amount": 1000,
#   "currency": "USD",
#   "beneficiary": {
#     "id": "beneficiary-uuid",
